@startuml sequence_live_update
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Relations - Live invalidation on commitment change

actor User
participant "Commitments Page" as CP
participant "API" as API
participant "EventBus" as EB
participant "Notifier" as N
participant "SignalR" as SR
participant "Invalidations$" as IS
participant "Tile" as T
participant "Controller" as C

User -> CP: Save new commitment (Health)
CP -> API: POST /commitments
API -> EB: CommitmentSavedEvent
EB -> N: subscriber
N -> SR: dashboardTileDataInvalidated [relations]
SR -> IS: emit
IS -> T: bindTileMode wakes
T -> C: load('live', null)
C -> API: GET /relations/summary
API --> C: { Health 47%, Work 30%, Personal 23% }
C --> T: signal updates
T --> User: Tile re-renders, LIVE pill

@enduml
